# AA-993 V3 (ADR 0016 D3) — HTTP rows of the CRM web post-deploy verify (service aa-crm-dev-web, host partner-dev.),
# read by .github/scripts/post_deploy_verify.sh crm-web. Format and variables: see crm.rows.
#
# The ECS rows (rollout COMPLETED, desired >= 1, image = <registry>/<repo>:<sha>) are fixed in the script; the
# sign-in redirect is checked by .github/scripts/edge_verify.sh crm-web (a row cannot read a Location header).
#
# The /crm/* rows prove the host's API rule still sits above the web default and that the API is up and ready. They do
# not compare the API's git_sha or version: a web deploy does not deploy the API (its own verify, crm.rows, does), so
# the API may run an older commit on a healthy Dev. $required is not used for the same reason.
#
# AA-1019: staff_auth_configured = the AA staff console (/staff/*) has its WORKFORCE client and cookie key.

healthz|public|GET /healthz|200|.status == "ok" and .service == "aa-crm-web" and .git_sha == $sha and .version == $version and .auth_configured == true and .staff_auth_configured == true
api-health|public|GET /crm/health|200|.status == "ok" and .service == "aa-crm-api"
api-ready|public|GET /crm/health/ready|200|.status == "ok" and .db == "ok"
